The Executive Director of the Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia said that the mechanism for receiving donations from Cambodian philanthropists abroad with the Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia has three main mechanisms:
First, the mechanism that the Cambodian embassies in other countries have assigned to coordinate as a focal point for the reception if there are people who volunteer to donate.
Second, through the Cambodian Association Abroad, which stands as a pillar for facilitation to receive this donation, but this participation is not yet permanent, it is still characteristically.
Thirdly, the direct online participation by the Kantha Bopha Foundation is just a bit more technical due to the need to go through partner banks abroad, such as permission to use credit cards.
Please be informed that Kantha Bopha Hospital is a children's hospital that was established and reopened in 1992, treating millions of children and spending an average of 43 million US dollars per year to carry out humanitarian operations to save lives. Children in Cambodia are free, quality and non-discriminatory.
