(Kampong Thom): Mr. Hak Mong Huot, Governor of Taing Kork District and Preah Monisil Vongton Pisey, Chief Inspector of Wat Kuho Nakorn, on July 2, 2024, opened the construction site of a 156-meter-long, 6-meter-wide concrete road in the village. Ta Prey, Pong village, Pong commune, Tang Kork district, while this road is an important road to facilitate travel, promote the economy and transport people more easily.
