Originally, this road was a red gravel road, but after Ton Pisey initiated the idea of improving into a concrete road, he led the construction of 2,102 meters of concrete road.
The district governor also said that the fact that the team had the opportunity to build roads for people to travel, transport and do business with ease and peace, because the country is completely peaceful, there is development resulting from the win-win policy. - Victory of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia. Samdech Techo, President of the Cambodian People's Party and the Royal Government, who always consider the lives of the people as necessary.
