The statement condemned North Korea, saying "relations between the United States, Japan and South Korea have emerged as a complete picture of the NATO-Asia profile" and the statement warned that NATO in Asia That will have serious consequences in return. "The United States and its allies have never ignored the actions of the United States in strengthening its military bloc in the region," North Korea said.
