CPP in Ratanakkiri Province Celebrates the 73rd Anniversary of the Establishment of the Cambodian People's Party
(Rattanakiri): The Cambodian People's Party of Ratanakkiri Province celebrated the 73rd anniversary of the founding of the Cambodian People's Party on June 28, 1951 - June 28, 2024, and this historic ceremony was held on the afternoon of June 30, 2024. At the Rattanak Theater of the Provincial Department of Culture and Fine Arts, presided over by Mr. Nhem Sam Oeun, President of the Cambodian People's Party, Ratanakkiri Province.
After Mr. Nab Bunheng, Vice Chairman of the Provincial Party Committee, read the full speech of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party, Mr. Nhem Sam Oeun expressed his great pleasure to participate in the celebration. Celebrating the 73rd anniversary of the founding of the Cambodian People's Party, originally known as the Khmer Revolutionary People's Party, originated from the Cambodian people's resistance movement against the colonialists for national independence.
On this occasion, the President of the Cambodian People's Party in Ratanakkiri province asked the party organizations at all levels, all party officials to pay attention to the following:
1. Must stand on the ideals of patriotism, combined with the path of multi-party liberal democracy, successfully implement the political program, principles, policies and decisions of the party.
2. The people are the decisive factor in the victory of the party in all circumstances, both during the national liberation struggle as well as in the stage of ruling the party. Therefore, all party organizations at all levels must connect with the people to address the requests and difficulties of the people and inspire the people to participate in the implementation of the party's political program.
3. Party ranks at all levels, strong and clean is the key to victory, because party officials are the link between the party and the people, the leading force, the driving force, and the implementation of the party's political program. At the same time, we must strictly prevent the inactivity of officials who violate the principles of the party and the laws of the state, affecting the rights and interests of the people.
4: Do not allow a handful of extremist politicians to destroy the peace, because the complete peace that we have established for more than 25 years is very difficult.
5. Party organizations at all levels, officials and party members must strive to maintain strong unity within the party on the basis of political programs, statutes, policies and policies of the party.
