This is the 10th meeting of the 8th Central Committee of the Korean Workers' Party, which started on Friday, with five points on the agenda approved. The meeting, chaired by Kim, is to review the work achieved in the first half of 2024 and make decisions on a number of key issues.
On June 19, North Korea and Russia revived an agreement reached during the Cold War and agreed to provide military assistance in case of any attack.
