Tamring Modern Agricultural Community Kampong Thom is the first community for cashew crops, which is scheduled to open in August.
(Kampong Thom): Mr. Khim Finang, Undersecretary of State and Spokesperson of the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, celebrated the birth of the "Kampong Thom Thomring Modern Agricultural Community", the first community for cashew crops and is scheduled to open in August. This face.
Please be informed that on June 28, 2024, the spokesperson of the Ministry of Agriculture led the Community Development Working Group to participate in the first General Assembly of the Cashew Community in Tamring Commune, Sandan District, Kampong Thom Province with the following results:
* First, this community decided to take the name "Tamring Modern Agricultural Community Kampong Thom" with 76 official members and 458 hectares of cashew production area.
* Second: The General Assembly of the community went smoothly and with the participation of the local administration, with the community electing 7 board members and 5 oversight committees.
* Thirdly, the community has approved the new statute of the modern agricultural community, which has just been revised according to the recommendation of Mr. Dith Tina, Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, and has set the principle of dividend distribution according to the formula of quantity ratio. The fruit of each member's farm
* Fifth: According to the conclusion and evaluation, after reviewing the pace of progress of the organization of "Modern Agricultural Community Tamring Kampong Thom" will be able to officially start in August after the business plan is completed and the loan from ARDB is Approved
* 6: Separately, the other 2 cashew communities in Kampong Thom province may start to operate in September and October 2024, and it is planned to take most of the documents from the modern agricultural community of Kampong Thom.
