According to Duke Song Saran, the order came after the company came to study the quality of rice and the supply system for the company. After studying and testing Cambodian rice, it was found that Cambodian rice is of good quality and has a high purity level of more than 90%, while the toxicity level is almost zero. Through this, he has high hopes that the company will continue to order more, which he expects to order about 60,000 tons of rice from Cambodia per year.
