The revival of our Khmer nation, liberated from the genocidal regime, the establishment of complete peace through win-win politics and the vibrant development of our society today is a historical fact that we are all Cambodians should have a clear understanding and always remember to ensure the construction of a prosperous future of Cambodia without genocide, national division and war again.
