(Kep): Mr. Som Piseth, Governor of Kep Province, on June 28, 2024, attended the groundbreaking ceremony for the construction of Crab Market Investment Project in Phum Thmey, Sangkat Prey Thom, Kep City, Kep Province. Many involved.
