Mr. Som Piseth emphasized that this investment is a factor that encourages and attracts more and more national and international tourists to come and relax, in line with the high recommendation of Samdech Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia in mobilizing development partners. Invest in their respective capitals and provinces.
At the same time, Mr. Som Piseth advised traders in Crab Market not to increase the price of their goods and services, which leads to tourists or customers reluctant to buy goods and services of traders in this province, leading to a shortage of tourists. Visit Kep and lose people's income through tourism.
Mr. Som Piseth also urged the traders to keep the goods clean and participate in cleaning the environment in Kep resort as well as in Kep province as a whole.
