(Phnom Penh): Samdech Prime Minister Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia, has sent a message of condolences to the death of 80-year-old Chapey Dong Veng Kong Nai, who died of a disease at his home in Doung village, Svay Tong commune, Kampong Trach district. Kampot province at 12:40 pm on June 28, 2024.
