Samdech Techo Hun Sen said, "I propose to the Royal Government on August 5, when the construction site of the Funan Techo Canal is opened, I would like to call on all pagodas and other places to play drums and fireworks on the night of "On August 5, more rockets will be fired where possible to show support for the project."
Samdech Techo Hun Sen said the project would create hundreds of thousands of years of opportunities for Cambodia to ensure that Cambodia could have its own sea transport route without having to go through other countries. Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that the canal will be a large ecosystem of Cambodia, which contributes to the prevention of climate change and contribute to the green area in the southwest in all seasons.
In the spirit of national unity, Samdech Techo Hun Sen would also like to thank our compatriots everywhere for their full support of the Funan Techo Canal Development Project, which will be opened in the near future. This is another strong national movement of the whole people, like the national movement to defend sovereignty, territorial integrity and the national movement to protect the health of the people in the past.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen emphasized that the Funan Techo Canal Project is an initiative born of the conscience and will of Cambodia, which will bring great benefits to Cambodia, such as gaining transportation distance, competitive price, increasing the system. Irrigation and flood relief, help expand southwestern cultivation, catch fisheries and aquaculture, as well as boost tourism.
At the same time, the Funan Techo canal will help Cambodia strengthen its political independence on water transport. The canal will not affect the environment and the flow of the Mekong River. This is an additional confirmation of Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
Please be informed that the Bassac River Navigation and Logistics System Project "Prek Chik Funan Techo" connects the river between the river to the Cambodian sea through Kandal, Takeo, Kampot and Kep provinces with a length of 180 km. 700 million US dollars.
