Member countries of the ASEAN Cement Manufacturers Association (AFCM) include: Brunei, Indonesia, Malaysia, the Philippines, Singapore, Thailand and Vietnam. Malaysia currently holds the chairmanship of the ASEAN Cement Manufacturers Association (AFCM), with member countries taking turns hosting the annual meeting.
