Today marks the 73rd anniversary of the founding of the Cambodian People's Party, Samdech Techo Hun Sen: The Cambodian People's Party is an important reference for building and developing the nation from the past, present and future.
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party, this morning, June 28, 2024, posted a message congratulating the 73rd anniversary of the founding of the Cambodian People's Party.
Samdech confirmed that June 28, 2024 is the 73rd anniversary of the party's birthday (June 28, 1951 - June 28, 2024). Since its inception, the Cambodian People's Party (CPP) has always adhered to its purpose and ideals: to stand with the people, to unite with the people, to overcome all obstacles, to dare to sacrifice relentlessly for an independent, peaceful, democratic, neutral and prosperous Cambodia. Society.
Samdech added that the Cambodian People's Party has built great achievements and merits for the nation and the people of Cambodia, this is the only political force that has stood up and gathered all the patriotic forces to form the United Front for National Salvation of Cambodia. To inspire and lead the people's movement throughout the country to overthrow the genocidal regime of Pol Pot.
Samdech stated that the Cambodian People's Party is an important reference for building and developing the nation from the past, present and future.
