The Colonel also continued that in the above operation, the specialized police force used 21 fire trucks, including 18 fire trucks of the Phnom Penh Municipal Office, using 12 trucks equal to 48 cubic meters of water. And 2 auxiliary vehicles from Olympia city, using 2 trucks equal to 08 cubic meters of water, and 1 truck of Cambodian Beer using 1 truck equal to 06 cubic meters of water.
