Dr. Nuon Danil added that not only the turning of rural roads, which were previously muddy, difficult to travel, it reduces time, budget, safe, does not cause disruption for students to school and people to Hospitals are faster than ever before, which is what the Royal Government is thinking, not just in Takeo province, but across the country.
With this, Dr. also called on the people who use this road to take care not to overweight, do not cut the road, do not want animals on the road or pour soil above the road, which makes the water when it rains Once caused damage to the road and so on.
Residents are happy to have achieved the new road, making it easier for them to travel, and the development of this road is in response to past requests and needs.
