Advisor Samdech Techo Hun Sen Presides Over the Groundbreaking Ceremony for the Construction of the Gate of the Monument Center
(Kandal): Mr. Has Vary, Personal Adviser to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party (CPP), this morning, June 26, 2024, presided over the groundbreaking ceremony for the construction of the gate of Mondul Chhat Monument in Rokar Kong II Commune, Muk Kampoul District, Kandal Province. Construction cost of nearly 20,000 dollars and distribution of gifts from Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit to Ta Chi Yai Chi and more than 100 poor people.
