Mr. Haswari said that the monument was built here under the personal care of Lim Lin to be a place for grandparents to practice meditation and Vipassana meditation to gain wisdom and knowledge. In addition to strengthening the mental and moral education of the dharma, what is more special is to provide a location for the burial of the needy.
