He also stated that the leaders and officials of the Cambodian People's Party, most of whom are Buddhists, always support Buddhism and perform meritorious deeds regularly in both the realm and the Buddhist realm. The Cambodian People's Party strives to build and unite the country under the win-win policy of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party, until the country has peace and development to this day.
At present, the head of the Royal Government, Samdech Bovathibodi Hun Manet, is still striving to strengthen, expand and promote the field of Buddhism to grow even more, according to Samdech Akka Moha Sena Padei Techo Hun Sen, the founder of peace in Cambodia, who always builds and leads the country to progress. Grow in all areas as well.
Please note that in this ceremony, in addition to the religious ceremonies, on behalf of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Mr. Has Vary also brought the gifts of Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit to distribute to grandparents and More than 100 poor people, including 16 vulnerable families, each family received 1 box of rice, 1 box of noodles, fish sauce, soy sauce, milk, sugar, salt, three Cheng Sarong, scarves and 55,000 riels.
