The purpose of this visit is to study and evaluate the outbreak of swarms of worms and to guide the farmers who participated in nearly 200 families on how to use pesticides to kill worms at a reasonable price and without affecting the environment and people's health. In accordance with the correct technical standards, efficient and effective.
Please be informed that Pursat province has been affected by the swarm of worms destroying the rice crop of the smallest of the other 15 farmers due to timely prevention, cutting off the invasion and spread of worms in both the area where the worms invaded and the area Other things that farmers spray to prevent pesticides.
However, a spokesman for the Ministry of Agriculture also called on farmers to inspect their fields regularly as they are currently in the process of erupting at swarms of worms, and if farmers are late to inspect. In time, the swarms of worms can destroy the rice crop in two to three days.
He added that if farmers encounter worms destroying rice crops, they should report or contact the nearest local authority or can contact the agricultural officials in the commune / district so that they can provide technical advice or methods. Choose a drug to kill the worms as well.
