Ms. Sithol described that before her family engaged in agriculture, she also mentioned the difference after her family changed their logging business many years ago, turning to mixed farming around the house in one month. She can earn more than 4 million riels.
She said that for the added value of her safety get a reasonable price, in which for a kilo of kale can sell for 4,000 or 3,000 riel per kilo, while the price of beans varies according to the actual market situation, while the original kale can Sold for 6,000 riel per kilogram. In a day, her family can earn about 200,000 or 100,000 riels to support the family life.
