Second. I would like to request the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports and relevant ministries, both public and private, to effectively implement the measures set out in the framework of the Digital Economy and Society Policy of Cambodia Digital 2021-2035 and the Digital Government Policy of Cambodia 2022. - 2035 to get the most out of Cambodia's digital revolution.
