First of all, I would like to express my deepest condolences to the families of the bodies of Tbong Lisong and Khin Kanchana, who died in the June 17, 2024 shooting. After the day of the incident, there was a debate regarding the prosecution of the perpetrators in the case of the shooting, with expressions of concern and fears that the perpetrators would not be severely punished by law or could have Guaranteed unusual bail.
