The Cambodia-China Stung Trang-Kroch Chhmar Friendship Bridge for nearly 3 years has greatly facilitated river crossings
(Tbong Khmum): "Cambodia-China Friendship Bridge Stung Trang - Kroch Chhmar" for almost 3 years has greatly facilitated the crossing of the river. This bridge is very special by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, nicknamed the "bridge connecting nature" between the two brothers: Kampong Cham and Tbong Khmum, giving good luck to the people in the northeastern region of Kratie, Stung Treng, Ratanakkiri.
Samdech Techo said that the bridge has the widest meaning, including:
* Bridge connecting nature between Cambodia and China * Bridge connecting nature between the people of the territory of Stung Trang district, Kampong Cham province to the territory of Krouch Chhmar district of Tbong Khmum province * Another special connection between the image of Samdech Techo himself with his wife Hometown: Stung Trang District, Kampong Cham Province, and Samdech Kittipritthbandit was born in Krouch Chhmar District, Tbong Khmum Province.
Please be informed that "Cambodia-China Stung Trang-Kroch Chhmar Friendship Bridge" was officially inaugurated on November 23, 2021 under the high presidency of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the former Prime Minister of Cambodia as of June 2024. It is almost 3 years old and greatly facilitates people's journey across the river.
The bridge cost about $ 57 million to build and took 42 months to build, starting on the west bank at Boeung Deng village, Prek Kak commune, Stung Trang district, Kampong Cham province, connecting to the east bank of the Mekong River at Kdol Kandal village, Trea commune, Krouch Chhmar district, province. Bee gems.
The bridge body is 1,131 meters long, 13.5 meters wide, paved with 5 cm thick rubber concrete, there are 2 lanes for cars, 2 lanes for motorbikes, 2 lanes for pedestrians.
