Please be informed that "Hong Waterfall" is a potential natural waterfall historical site in Tbong Khmum province. With an 8-meter-high waterfall accompanied by a spectacular natural landscape, the provincial authorities have set a goal to develop the area into a model tourist destination for the province in the future.
The "Hong Waterfall" natural resort is located in Kampang commune, Memot district, Tbong Khmum province, about 38 kilometers from the provincial town.
