On that occasion, Major General Chan Sopheaktra sent a message of condolences from Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, as well as Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Lok Chumteav Bandith. Present here, as well as all troops and military families throughout the Preah Vihear military operation area.
