(Prey Veng): Mr. Duch Kunthea, Deputy Governor of Prey Veng Province, on June 21, 2024, brought 143 helmets donated by Samdech Prime Minister Hun Manet to the students of Kamchay Mear High School and Cheach Srok High School. Kamchay Mear, Prey Veng Province.
Mr. Duch Kunthea said that in order to strengthen and implement road traffic safety on the road from the public to be more efficient, we would like to ask our children, students, youth, people from all walks of life to travel nearby. Far from participating, everyone should wear a helmet, because wearing this helmet can save the life of the driver and will not cause head injuries.
