The 7 points of Samdech Maniphea Hun Manet to all stakeholders include:
First, to participate in promoting and encouraging students, youth, parents, guardians, workers, employers, private sector and the general public to better understand the harmful effects and destruction of drugs by saying "absolutely no to drugs".
Second: Participate in downloading and using the NoDrug mobile application of the National Anti-Drug Authority to receive education, content, lessons, information, services, treatment and rehabilitation and report to the authorities in case of drug use or distribution. In the community.
Third, encourage all private sectors to invest with the Royal Government in the promotion and dissemination of education by all means and in all forms.
Fourth, continue to implement the principles of "cleaning our house" and "cleaning wolves from the lake" by increasing the regular inspection of officials of ministries, institutions and sub-national administrations and strict measures related to drugs to promote Confidence, efficiency, good governance and cleanliness.
Fifth, the Capital and Provincial Unity Command must continue to implement the policy of "safe villages, communes, sangkats" by eliminating the distribution and use of drugs in the community, especially in clubs and entertainment venues, based on the spirit of "3 do not 1 Report »is not involved, do not intervene, do not relax and be reported.
Sixth: Encourage parents and guardians whose family members are drug addicts and ministries, institutions and sub-national administrations whose officials are drug addicts and who have been expelled from the framework to receive treatment and rehabilitation. Rehabilitation to have the opportunity to integrate back into society.
And 7th: The Anti-Illegal Drug Campaign Command must continue to pay attention to strengthening its roles and responsibilities by complying with the duties and responsibilities of the relevant ministries, institutions and units at both the national and sub-national levels for the owner. Implementing within its jurisdiction to be highly effective.
