The ASEAN Secretary-General also encouraged Kazakhstan to increase its engagement with ASEAN through the Shanghai Cooperation Organization, the EU-Asia Economic Cooperation, the Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation Forum and the Confidence-Building Measures in Asia.
Mr Serzhan Abdykarimov acknowledged ASEAN's important role in promoting peace and stability in the region. He also expressed readiness to work closely with ASEAN to strengthen Kazakhstan relations and cooperation with ASEAN and ASEAN Member States.
Kazakhstan appointed its first ambassador to ASEAN in 2014. The ASEAN Committee in Astana was formally established in March 2014 to promote ASEAN relations and cooperation with Kazakhstan in the host country.
