The Director of Pursat Provincial Technical Institute added that "Techo Sen Digital Heritage Building" will also contribute to help Pursat Province achieve the vocational and technical training plan for young people from poor and vulnerable families. 5 million people under the national program of the Royal Government of Cambodia.
A 1-month-old baby was left by his father near Orussey III Sangkat, Khan 7 Makara
Ms. Mom Chandani said that on the morning of Thursday, June 20, 2024, after receiving reports that people found the baby was thrown by a man in the area of Sangkat Or Russey 3.
O'Russey 3 police officers took the baby and to find the guardians of the parents, suddenly a woman carrying another 2-year-old girl came out claiming to be her child that her husband had left behind near the commune.
