This instruction was made on the occasion of the President on the occasion of the 47th anniversary of the struggle of Samdech Techo Hun Sen to overthrow the genocidal regime in the military historical area of Techo Koh Thmor 16 in Koh Thmor village, commune Tonlong, Memot district, Tbong Khmum province.
