With its precise geographical location, Techo Santepheap Park is also equipped with the equipment and weapons used during the Civil War. The park has also become a historical building that people admire and consider as a practical geographical process.
The Royal Government has designated 87 military historical sites in the 3rd Military Zone, 4th Military Zone, 5th Military Zone and Anlong Veng Historical Tourist Area, which are located in 12 provinces. Pursuant to the Government Sub-Decree on the Demarcation of Military Historic Areas through Sub-Decree No. 155 dated 11 July 2023.
The creation of the historical site, known as the "Techo Historical Heritage Site", aims to ensure the authenticity of historical truth for future generations to learn and promote the values of win-win politics from the national to international levels that become historical heritage. The world.
