Singapore-Cambodia Business Leaders Hold a Dinner to Discuss Cooperation and Opportunity for Further Growth
(Singapore): On June 19, 2024, Ms. Cham Nimmol, Minister of Commerce and Mr. Chea Vuthy, Secretary General of the Board of Investment of Cambodia, presided over the Singapore-Cambodia Business Leaders for a guest breakfast.
The Singapore-Cambodia Business Leaders Breakfast is a forum for business leaders from both countries to discuss and explore further collaboration and growth opportunities, especially the presence of logistics-related businesses.
The event highlighted the strong economic ties between Singapore and Cambodia and the potential for mutual benefit in the supply chain and the logistics sector.
The course will cover areas including business operations, business development, operational optimization, technology and global supply chain contexts.
After the signing of the MoU, the representatives of the two companies were exchanged with each other under the highest presidency of His Excellency Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia at the Singapore-Cambodia Business Forum.
"This MOU is a milestone in our commitment to developing Cambodia's supply chain and logistics sector," said Ian Dyason, CEO of SCALA. "Through this partnership, we will provide an opportunity for Cambodia's logistics sector to train its workforce in Singapore, providing them with the skills needed to grow in this dynamic industry."
(Tbong Khmum): June 20, 1977 was the day that Comrade Hun Sen and four other loyal comrades, including Comrades Nuch Thorn, Nhek Huon, San Sanh and Vapo Ian, risked their lives to walk in the dark night. Dark leaves his headquarters in Koh Thmor village, Tonlong commune, Memot district, to Vietnam, seeking support to overthrow the genocidal regime of Pol Pot, save the nation and the lives of the Cambodian people.
Starting from the sacrifices made 47 years ago, which led to the Cambodian nation has the opportunity to build and develop to be glorious, to receive the light shining like the full moon today. In particular, help people have a fresh smile, like Bopha is dew in the morning.
