(Phnom Penh): On June 18, 2024, the technical team of the Department of Crop Protection, Sanitation and Hygiene of the General Department of Agriculture cooperated with the Department of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries of Tbong Khmum and Siem Reap to inspect and intervene to get rid of pests. Rice in Dauntei commune, Ponhea Krek district, and cassava in Kork commune, Tambor district, and Neang Am modern community in Siem Reap province.
