* First, instructed the farmers to continue to monitor the presence of contaminants that are occurring in the fields on a regular basis and report to the Agricultural Technical Officer.
* Second: Advised farmers on measures to prevent and get rid of swarms to get high efficiency.
* Third: As of June 18, 2024, 55 hectares of rice and 5 hectares of cassava in Tbong Khmum province and 50 hectares of rice in Siem Reap were destroyed by swarms.
