A man died on the way to the hospital after being hit by a motorbike carrying a heavy tree in Rolea Bier district.
(Kampong Chhnang): A man died after being taken to the hospital because he was hit by a motorbike with a bulldozer behind him at more than 7:00 pm on June 17, 2024 on the piece National Road No. 53 at the point of Travak village, Prey Moul commune, Rolea Bier district, Kampong Chhnang province.
According to the Chrebak Administrative Police Chief, immediately after the incident, his administrative police force cooperated with the traffic police force of the Rolea Bier District Police Inspectorate to search and search for the bulldozer that the owner had driven out of the place. The incident happened all night and the above bulldozer was found hidden in Alleng village, Chrey Bak commune, Rolea Beer district, while the driver escaped during the night.
He further stated that immediately after the incident, the driver of the bulldozer did not stop to deal with the victim at the scene, as he drove the bulldozer away from the scene, dragging the victim's motorcycle. The victim, who was stuck with a bulldozer more than a kilometer behind, escaped from the bulldozer, while the bulldozer and several heavy trees that were transported on the bulldozer were hidden in the area. .
He added that the bulldozers and exhibits were temporarily stored at the location where the bulldozers were hidden in the village of Aleng, and that he had sent the People's Defense Forces and his administrative post guards to wait. Guard, waiting for orders from higher ups.
He said that the victim in the above incident lives in Trapeang Ta Sok village, while the driver of the bulldozer lives in Ta Vak village, Prey Moul commune, Rolea Bier district. Prior to the incident, the truck was carrying many heavy trees and was driving at night due to lack of caution on both sides, which caused such an accident. Kampong Chhnang province as well.
