(Phnom Penh): With the high permission of His Excellency Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia, Duke Kith Meng, President of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce and Chairman of the ASEAN Business Advisory Council for Cambodia, this morning led a delegation of the Chamber of Commerce. Cambodian Prime Minister accompanied by the Prime Minister on an official visit to Singapore from June 18 to 19, 2024.
