At this point, Samdech President Hun Manet said that initially, the inter-ministerial working group planned to propose to set the year by banning the import of old cars into Cambodia not older than 10 years to ensure the environment as well as avoid the import of old cars. Come to use in Cambodia. But the proposal was rejected by the prince.
"I understand the care of the environment, we do not want to take old cars that are difficult to use technically can cause accidents. So I say there is no need to set a year, but strengthen the technical inspection of the car to be clear, this is right and we do that.
In addition, Samdech President Hun Manet also announced the permission to import cars from abroad indefinitely, but must strengthen the inspection on the car technical system properly. The Royal Government encourages local car manufacturers and also encourages competition to import used cars from abroad to use in the country, especially to guarantee affordable prices to allow people to buy them. Available.
