The International Medical Conference on "The latest solutions and technologies for children with hearing loss, language and speech development" aims to bring together leading scientists and physicians in the fields of pediatric neurology, psychology and rehabilitation, as well as Technology developers and healthcare providers to discuss the latest advances in diagnosis, prevention and treatment of the disease in children.
Key topics that will be presented and discussed under the theme "The latest solutions and technologies for children with hearing loss, language development and speech" include:
* First: Better child care in language development and speech crisis solutions
* Second: Understand the abnormalities of children's brain development through scientific research
* Third: The latest technology in the medical management of children with brain disorders.
