(Svay Rieng): Two girls, cousins, were playing under a rice barn, while the grandmother set fire to a nearby garbage fire, which spread to the rice barn, causing a fatal fire that shocked you. The villagers came to help put out the fire and there was a call from the police to bring a water truck to put out the fire, but unfortunately the two girls died.
This case happened at 6:00 pm on June 14, 2024 in Russey Douch village, Reach Mondir commune, Kampong Ror district.
According to the local police, there was a case of fire in a rice barn and a straw factory that killed two girls, 2-year-old Win Bormey, and 2-year-old Phal Rin Chenna, a 2-year-old girl in Russey Doch village, Reach Mondir commune, Kampong Ror district. There is a father named Phlok Pov Narin, a doctor from Mondul Kampong Ror.
Police said that before the incident, the two children, cousins, came to sit under the barn, while the grandmother set fire to chicken wings and garbage nearby, and the grandmother sat and took pictures, forgetting. The grandson under the barn suddenly spread the fire to the barn and the haystack, causing a huge fire that left both children dead.
