Thailand's actions in encroaching on Cambodian territory Analysts say Thailand intends to use a strategy to end UN Security Council condemnation and international community discrimination. Not only that, the Thai strategy is to use time as a tool and make the Cambodian people forget about the territory and feel dissatisfied with the politics of the Royal Government of Cambodia.
Another necessary strength is ownership of economic development. At this point, we must dare to acknowledge that in the past, farmers along the Thai and Vietnamese borders were dependent on the sale of agricultural products to these neighboring countries. As a result, Thailand has always been arrogant about its economic ties with Cambodia.
The necessary issue that both Cambodia and Thailand should start is to recognize the historical truth, that is, it is time to research and write history in unison.
If Cambodia is strong as mentioned above, it can make Cambodia no longer sit and wait for the smoke and move to play the role of firefighter and have enough ability to manage its own political geography.
