* 2: To develop an action plan within its jurisdiction to participate in the implementation of the 9th plan to fight against illegal drugs through the strengthening of education plans, dissemination of administrative measures and legal measures to strictly prevent the use of trafficking. Distribution of all kinds of illegal drugs.
