(Phnom Penh): General Sao Sokha, Deputy Commander of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and Commander of the National Gendarmerie, has sent an inspection team to investigate the case of Pailin Provincial Deputy Gendarmerie Commander Colonel Bun Soeung in a dispute with a taxi driver. 20,000 riels.
Speaking to Fresh News on the afternoon of June 13, 2024, General Sao Sokha confirmed, "We are investigating the case and the National Gendarmerie Command, after receiving this information, we have assigned an inspection. The case has already been inspected. "We are now awaiting the results of the inspection to find a solution to this case."
It should be noted that during these two days, there was a lot of sharing on the network of a dispute between a taxi driver and the Deputy Commander of the Pailin Provincial Armed Forces, Mr. Sar Bun Soeung, which caused criticism and urged the management to take action against the Deputy Commander. This picture.
According to the report, at 8 pm on June 11, 2024, Mr. Sar Bunsoeung, known as the Deputy Commander of the Pailin Provincial Gendarmerie, was accused by a taxi driver of taking his son to catch a child. He was in Phsar Prom because of 20,000 riel.
Regarding this case, General Sao Sokha considered that "the reaction of others is not wrong because it is freedom of expression, but we have to find out the truth because we can not go to solve problems that we do not know the process "Originally, we do not hold anyone who violates the law."
Once again, General Sao Sokha reiterated his motto: "The country must protect the people, must serve the law, must respect crime, must suppress" and the other motto is "think, help, work together, take responsibility".
On the morning of June 13, 2024, Ms. Ban Srey Mom, Governor of Pailin Province, also invited the team to meet with the taxi owners and village chiefs to explain the procedures, legal mechanisms and find a solution to this case.
Ms. Ban Srey Mom stated, "This issue may be a secondary case. I guarantee a win-win situation, but only for the implementation of the law of the Code of Discipline of civil servants, I hand over to the management to decide the law equally for all officials."
Following this incident, it was reported that Mr. Bun Soeung had been involved in a scandal involving violence that resulted in the death of a suspect in a temporary detention center in Banteay Meanchey province and was sentenced to four years in prison. Suddenly, he became the Deputy Commander of the Pailin Provincial Armed Forces. However, under the command of General Sao Sokha, these problems will be found and resolved.
