He also condemned Sam Rainsy, a convicted felon who opposed the Funan-Techo Prek Chik project, which was destroying national interests. The Anlong Veng Peace Center distributed 16 wheelchairs to people with disabilities in Cheung Phnom village.
(Oddar Meanchey): Anlong Veng Peace Center in collaboration with Anlong Veng District Administration provided 16 wheelchairs to 16 people with war or congenital disabilities living in Cheung Phnom Village, Trapeang Prey Commune, Anlong Veng District, Oddar Meanchey Province on 12 June. 2024.
The wheelchair distribution program is designed to alleviate the burden of displacement for work and learning, and to promote the equal participation of people with disabilities in social and equitable activities. Support a non-discriminatory social environment for people with disabilities.
The provision of wheelchairs to the disabled in Cheung Phnom village of Anlong Veng district is a humanitarian gesture due to the consequences of war and unexploded ordnance.
Anlong Veng district is widely known as the last stronghold of the Khmer Rouge movement, which was integrated into the Royal Government of Cambodia on December 29, 1998. Many people in the community have suffered scars, both physical and mental.
Wheelchair distribution program was first held in Cheung Phnom village as it was designated as a village for the disabled during the Khmer Rouge resistance period between 1979 and 29. December 1998.
(Kampot): Another loyalist to Sam Rainsy in Kampot province has announced his secession from the fugitive prisoners and asked to live with Samdech Techo Hun Sen under the shadow of the Cambodian People's Party.
Mr. Trung Sophon has been involved in politics with Mr. Sam Rainsy in Kampot province since 1995, starting with the Khmer National Party, then the Sam Rainsy Party, the CNRP, and finally the Candlelight Party.
Mr. Trung Sophon is a person who is very loyal to Mr. Sam Rainsy and has worked hard to serve the political activities of the opposition party.
Mr. Trung Sophon claimed that his loyalty for many years, because he believed in the pull of Mr. Sam Rainsy and their allies, made him a passionate opponent of good and bad.
After supporting the opposition for nearly 30 years, Trung Sophon has now announced his secession from Sam Rainsy and the opposition, with no more faith in their dark political ideology.
With the declaration of secession from the opposition, the former leader of the opposition party in Kampot province also announced to join the political life with the Cambodian People's Party led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
Mr. Trung Sophon stated that now he clearly understands that only the Cambodian People's Party, especially Samdech Techo Hun Sen, has built great merits for the nation and the people by liberating the country from the genocidal regime and ending the flames of war. Unite the nation, find peace and build the nation to prosper until now.
Mr. Trung Sophon asked for mercy from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, do not blame the wrongdoer for many years and allow him to live with the Cambodian People's Party from now on.
