Mr. Khuong Sreng: Those who charge more than the tax book can face the law can be sent to court to serve the sentence
(Phnom Penh): The Governor of Phnom Penh, Mr. Khuong Sreng, instructed the Khan Authority, especially the Chairman of the State Market Commission in Phnom Penh, to implement the strictest measures to collect taxes in excess of the charge book, and those who charge more than the charge book can Facing the law can be sent to court to serve the sentence.
This instruction was made this morning, June 13, 2024, in an emergency meeting with Khan authorities and all state market commissions in Phnom Penh.
Mr. Khuong Sreng said that district authorities should call tax collectors to make a record. If they still violate the instructions twice, we have to cancel the contract. In the market, there must be a good environment, that is, after the sale must be cleaned. In addition, there is no gambling in the market.
Mr. Khuong Sreng insisted that taking the tax in excess of the charge book was tantamount and that the company would face the law and would not be allowed to bid again. For this seventh mandate, we must carry out this work with the utmost determination, as the perpetrators will be punished.
In this meeting, the Phnom Penh Municipal Authority decided that the authorities as well as the chairmen of all market commissions must strictly enforce the tax collection at the markets in Phnom Penh, especially at the location of sending bicycles.
At the place where the motorcycle is sent, the price must be clearly stated by writing at the place where the motorcycle is sent that there is no charge in excess of the charge book. In case of being forced to charge more than the charge book, please call the district authority. Phone number at that location already.
All tax investors must meet with their agents to ensure that they comply with the charge book. All tax collection agencies must have a valid uniform name tag. Make a list of all the money and send it to the authorities.
In case of exceeding the value of the charge book, the authority will cancel the contract immediately and if it is found that the taxpayer has violated and taking more money than the charge book will face arrest and sent to court. This work must be handed over to the Khan Market and the Department of Economics and Finance for regular inspection and monthly meetings.
