Sihanoukville Investment Promotion Team Launches Dispute Resolution Method for Stuck Building Project in Sihanoukville
(Phnom Penh): The Investment Promotion Team in Sihanoukville has launched a dispute resolution approach for projects involving jams in Sihanoukville to expedite the settlement of disputes, while some disputes are being resolved out of court.
The "Sihanoukville Investment Promotion Special Program 2024" sets out measures to "promote the use of out-of-court dispute resolution mechanisms in accordance with legal provisions for investment-related disputes."
Through this, the working group decided to provide incentives, favors and facilitation procedures, as well as dispute mediation to many investors or businessmen who have plans related to the stuck building. As a result, some disputes have been settled out of court and some are in the process of mediation to be resolved in the future.
