This morning, Samdech Hun Sen Presented Diplomas to 540 Lim Kok Wing University Students
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Thursday, June 13, 2024, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet, presided over the graduation ceremony for Lim University students. About 540 Kok Wing graduates. The graduation ceremony was held at PH Grand Hall, Peng Huoth Borey.
Lim Kok Wing University is a well-known higher education institution in Cambodia that specializes in Architecture and Interior Design, Costume Design and Graphic Design, Software Engineering and Business Management. From the 2007-2008 academic year to the 2022-2023 academic year, the total number of graduates from Lim Kok Wing University in Cambodia was 1,525, 711 of whom were female.
Please note that Lim Kok Wing University was established in 1991, based in Malaysia and has branches in Asia, Europe and Africa. The university has trained tens of thousands of outstanding intellectual students from more than 150 different countries.
Lim Kok Wing University has 5 faculties, including: 1) Faculty of Architecture and Design, 2) Faculty of Arts, Literature and Humanities, 3) Faculty of Mathematics and Humanities, 4) Faculty of Social Sciences and Communications International and 5) Faculty of Business Administration.
