Oddar Meanchey Provincial Court Detains 9 Gangsters for Cutting a Knife in Sangkat O'Smach, Samrong City
(Oddar Meanchey): Nine gangsters were remanded in custody by the Oddar Meanchey Provincial Court in connection with an attempted murder and conspiracy to commit murder. Separately, four other gangsters who escaped are being sought for arrest by the authorities.
