The gang used a machete and a machete to cut one of the victims, causing serious injuries. After questioning the accused and examining the evidence, the investigating judge decided to detain the accused in order to continue the investigation in accordance with the law.
For the activities of gangsters that affect public order and the well-being of the people, the court has been continuing to enforce the law in the strictest and strictest way.
