* Second, the Municipal, District and Commune Administrative Unity Command must disseminate the policy of "Safe Village, Commune, Sangkat" to students of all schools, business owners and entertainment venues to prevent student inactivity at business locations, eliminate Gangs, illegal gambling, drugs and all kinds of crime in their locality.
* Third: Develop a specific plan to eliminate gang activity at the local level. In the future, a list of gangsters in each locality must be prepared in order to have clear educational and management measures.
* Fourth, all public and private educational institutions must continue to work with local authorities, guardians, students and the community to prevent the absence of students during school hours and must continue to strengthen the presence of students to participate in eliminating student inactivity in gatherings, playing games. Online smoking, e-cigarettes and stealing illegal drugs.
Fifth, along with the implementation of educational and administrative measures, attention must be paid to prevention, prevention and strict legal action without leniency and without exception for gangs.
Received this instruction from the Unified Command of Municipal, District, Department-Unit around the province and Commune / Sangkat administration with high efficiency. Must be assigned to implement from the date of signing with a sense of responsibility and efficiency.
