He confirmed that after the incident and under the strict command of Major General Sous Sok Dara, Preah Vihear Provincial Police Commissioner, he led the provincial low-level criminal police force to investigate and arrest the children. Twelve gang members from both gangs and confiscated exhibits including: 7 motorcycles, 4 swords and 2 knives.
