Following the instructions of Samdech Hun Sen, the verbal dispute between Mr. Khov Chhay and Mr. Dao Ly Duch was resolved and jointly promoted Khmer martial arts
(Phnom Penh): Following the instructions of Samdech Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on the afternoon of June 11, 2024, Dr. Thong Khon, Senior Minister in charge of Special Mission and Chairman of the National Olympic Committee of Cambodia (NOCC) chaired the meeting. A mediation between Mr. Khov Chhay, President of the Khmer Boxing Federation and Dao Ly Duch.
The meeting was held at the headquarters of the National Olympic Committee of Cambodia with the participation of Mr. Vath Chamroeun, Secretary General of the NOCC and Secretary of State of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports and Oknha Srey Chanthorn, Honorary Vice President of the Khmer Boxing Federation.
As a result, both parties agreed that Dao Ly Duch was willing to continue to help promote Khmer martial arts on the national and international stage.
Mr. Khov Chhay also expressed his congratulations, welcome and always ready to cooperate with Mr. Dao Ly Duch in depth in accordance with the principles and statutes of the Khmer Boxing Federation under the joint spirit to promote Khmer boxing to be more famous on stage. International.
