Minister Neth Pheaktra emphasized that the signing of this occasion is the creation of a new opportunity in the context of the rapid economic growth of the Kingdom of Cambodia in general and in particular the growth of the liquor industry and outreach operations. Responsible to uphold the common interests and national economic interests.
