(Phnom Penh): Deputy Prime Minister Sun Chanthol, First Vice President of the Council for the Development of Cambodia, has been visiting the European Union to seek to attract and persuade EU investors to invest in Cambodia.
The mobilization of foreign investment in Cambodia is a necessary task in the policy of the Royal Government of the 7th legislature of the National Assembly, led by Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia. As the Royal Government's Chief of Staff for Investment, Deputy Prime Minister Sun Chanthol often travels to other countries to attract investment.
