(Prey Veng): Many families in Doung village, Kanhchum commune, Pearang district, Prey Veng province, reacted with the director of Prey Pnov health center who encroached on state public land. Come on, still no action, just a promise.
The people's reaction came on June 9, 2024, after Mr. Sim Soeun, director of Prey Pnov Health Center, planted a stone pillar, encroached on and occupied the state's public land. With this case, Mr. Sim Soeun, Director of Prey Pnov Health Center, admitted that he actually planted stone pillars, demarcated and occupied public land, based on the reason for managing and maintaining the road.
Please note that this disputed land is public land of the state, more than 70 meters wide and more than 80 meters long at the eastern point next to the base of the coconut bridge in Doung village, Kanhchum commune, Pearang district, Prey Veng province.
Residents stated that a few years ago, Mr. Sim Soeun collected farmland from farmers in the back, while there was no way out in front of Mr. Sim Soeun, he decided to fill the canal and clear some ditches, which are state public land. To have its entrance to the land behind.
At the same time, the people request to keep this land as public property of the same state, not to become private property, private road, and not to be under the control of any person, and the land at the above point, the people leave for use as The common interest, whether near or far, in which even Mr. Sim Soeun can use and access as needed.
In connection with the case of encroachment on public land by the director of Prey Phnov Health Center from the director of Prey Phnov Health Center, the people strongly oppose any arrangement to take this public land as a private road, private property or build a fence.
Regarding the above allegations, the director of Prey Pnov Health Center said that he had indeed occupied the above public land for a long time, because he had asked the pagoda committee before pouring land to build a road for many residents. He kept encroaching on his land, so he planted stone pillars to mark the border.
The director of the health center confirmed that he did occupy the state's public land, but if the state needed it, he would return it if the land at the above point was to be returned as state property, so that people would not build anything on the land. And he did not do anything on that land either, leaving it all together before he agreed.
As for Mr. Ith Sim, the chief of Kanhchum commune, he admitted that the disputed land at the above point was indeed public land, but seeing that Mr. Sim Soeun was trying to occupy the road, the commune chief decided to issue a letter to Mr. Sim Soeun. Road maintenance, and the letter does not mean that Mr. Sim Soeun is the owner.
However, the people of Doung village would like to urge Mr. Suon Somalin, Governor of Prey Veng Province, to take action against his subordinates, Mr. Sim Soeun, Director of Prey Pnov Health Center, while he was a civil servant, he occupied the public land of the state until his birth. Conflict with hundreds of families. Mr. Sok Puthivuth thanked all stakeholders who promote the work of scholarships for poor students, Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittiprittbandit to grow.
