In a speech to France, McConnell said the results of Sunday's European Parliament election were a major concern for his government and he could not stand idly by. He added that the first round of French parliamentary elections will be held on June 30 and the second round on July 7.
However, preliminary results show that right-wing, center-left and liberal parties will continue to hold a majority in the 460-seat European Parliament. The turnout alone was lower than in the previous term, when the parties held 488 of the 705 European Parliament seats. The Banking Association of Cambodia warns of some fraudulent websites that disguise themselves as "online lending" banking institutions
(Phnom Penh): The Anti-Fraud Working Group of the Banking Association of Cambodia has recently noted that a number of fraudulent websites have been misrepresented as legitimate financial institutions or financial institutions in connection with "fake online loans". Facebook page term.
The Banking Association of Cambodia would like to remind the public to always be careful not to transfer money, do not pay anything by scanning KHQR or providing personal information.
In case of doubt, please contact your institution immediately to confirm additional information such as the means used by the official institution to communicate with its customers or request other instructions.
Please also note that official banking and financial institutions will not ask their customers to provide bank passwords or any personal information.
