1: Capacity development of officers and capacity building, focusing on officer training activities, sharing of knowledge and experience, strengthening leadership and organizational capacity, implementation of performance-based management systems
2. Strengthening and expanding partnerships that focus on promoting cooperation with national ministries and institutions and sub-national administrations, partnerships with national and international educational institutions, as well as cooperation with development partners.
3: Curriculum development and promotion of research focusing on the development of continuing and early training programs, online training and multidisciplinary methods, training programs based on cooperation with international partners and the needs of the Ministry of Education Research, compile documents and case studies
