(Svay Rieng): Eight leaders of the Candlelight Party in Sangkat Svay Rieng, Svay Rieng City, Svay Rieng Province have decided to leave the party they used to engage in political activities with and join the CPP.
The eight opposition leaders are all individuals who have been active in supporting the opposition for many years. They decided to leave the party because they lost faith in the leadership and the way of life of the opposition, which is divided, partisan and lacks transparency in leadership.
