He also informed the Chinese side that the Ministry of Information plans to lead an anti-fake news campaign in the near future and intends to expand the anti-fake news campaign in a broader framework, as the issue of fake news is a common problem and all countries face it. Faced with these problems that require all of us to work together to fight.
