(Oddar Meanchey): The second friendly cycling event in 2024 between Cambodia's Meanchey province and Thailand's Surin province, Sisaket province, started this morning, June 8, 2024 at the O'Smach International Border Crossing in O'Smach. Samrong, Oddar Meanchey Province.
