The second friendly cycling event in 2024 starts from O'Smach International Border Crossing in Samrong City to Anlong Veng District and then returns to Thailand via Choam International Border Crossing. This event shows the good relations between the two countries (Cambodia-Thailand), especially the border provinces of Oddar Meanchey, Surin and Sisaket.
