(Central): The lower extremities of the opposition at the grassroots level are running away from their party like the floods of the rainy season due to frustration, disappointment, loss of faith in the leadership of the party leadership, disintegration among leaders. Opposition. In particular, the opposition to the Funan Techo canal project by Mr. Sam Rainsy.
On June 8, 2024, the leaders of eight other members of the Candlelight Party in Khpob Atav commune, Leuk Dek district, Kandal province, announced their departure from the Candlelight Party.
They have been trying to help the party for many years, expecting the party to prosper. But contrary to their expectations, the opposition weakened from year to year, and the party leaders split and ran to form their own new party. In particular, they are angry with Sam Rainsy, who opposes the Funan Techo canal project, which is beneficial to the nation.
Along with leaving the party they have been with for many years, the leaders and members of the fire party in the commune also announced to join the political life with the Cambodian People's Party, which is leading the country.
(Prey Veng): Mr. Abhisit Dr. Sar Sokha, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of Interior and Chairman of the Prey Veng Provincial Government Working Group, reminded all officials not to be 10-legged officials who sit in the office waiting to sign documents or Report the work results from lower-level officials by helping the locals to stick with the people.
