Deputy Prime Minister Sar Sokha instructed all Royal Government working groups in Prey Veng to study, monitor and evaluate the achievements of the Royal Government's policy implementation in order to successfully implement the first phase of the Pentagon Strategic Political Program, Strategic Development Plan. National and various reform programs of the Royal Government, the 7th legislature of the National Assembly.
Mr. Aphisantbandit continued to encourage and encourage digital dissemination to people from all walks of life to participate in the implementation of the policy "Safe Village-Commune-Sangkat" to jointly prevent and suppress all kinds of crimes in their respective localities, especially crime. Illegal drugs, gangs, human trafficking, theft, robbery and illegal gambling in all localities.
It should be noted that the visit of the Royal Government Working Group is a mechanism to help promote the grassroots activities of sub-national officials and to solve some challenges to help improve work efficiency, improve people's livelihood and promote Social and economic development.
