Speaking on that occasion, His Excellency General Vong Pisen conveyed greetings and memories from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Senate, Samdech Katiprittbandit and Samdech Moha Bovathip Hun Sen, Prime Minister and Lok Chumteav Bandit to all forces. Dedicate physical and mental strength to fulfill the task of protecting the territorial integrity of the motherland.
His Excellency the Commander-in-Chief also expressed his appreciation and appreciation for the spirit of self-sacrifice and overcoming all obstacles with the heroic courage of the officers, soldiers of the Armed Forces and the National Police in the 4th Army Division. National defense, peace, stability and social order.
His Excellency emphasized that the peace we have is due to the sacrifice of the lives of the leaders and the success of the implementation of the win-win policy set by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, which ended the war completely and brought about the development of the country. Prosperous people live in harmony. So we all have to keep the peace at all costs.
