Inter-Ministerial Commission announces the organization of the Poetry, Songwriting and Painting Competition to commemorate the day on the road to the overthrow of the genocidal regime
(Phnom Penh): The Inter-Ministerial Commission to Organize the Commemoration of the 47th Anniversary of the Day of Remembrance of the Journey to the Overthrow of the Pol Pot Genocidal Regime 20 June 1977-20 June 2024 Songs and paintings commemorate this historic day.
Historical event At 21:00 on June 20, 1977, Comrade Hun Sen, the current Samdech Akka Moha Sena Padei Techo Hun Sen, President of the Senate of the Kingdom of Cambodia, along with four cadres, traveled to the border area. Cambodia, Vietnam In order to seek support from the Party and State of Vietnam to build an armed force to overthrow the genocidal regime of Pol Pot, liberate the country and save the lives of the Cambodian people.
This fact of history is remembered and commemorated every year from 2017, the 40th anniversary to the present. On May 30, 2024, the Head of the Royal Government issued Resolution No. 103 Pillar. On the Establishment of an Inter-Ministerial Commission to Organize the Commemoration of the 47th Anniversary of the Day of Remembrance of the Journey to the Overthrow of the Pol Pot Genocidal Regime, June 20, 1977 - June 20, 2024.
In order to inspire this historical event to reach more levels of the masses, the Chairman of the Inter-Ministerial Commission has introduced the following disciplines: Poetry, Songwriting and Painting, which are related to the four major events.
The following is the full notice: Phnom Penh Municipal Police presented 24 suspects after cracking down on 4 crimes before sending them to court
(Phnom Penh): With the permission of Lt. Gen. Chuon Narin, Deputy Commissioner and Phnom Penh Municipal Police Commissioner, on the afternoon of June 7, 2024, Lt. Col. Sam Vicheka, Spokesman of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police Commission, held a press conference. A total of 24 suspects who committed 4 crimes.
Colonel Sam Vichheka confirmed that the crimes related to the 24 suspects include:
* First: In the case of illegal drug trafficking and use, 10 suspects were detained by the police in Sen Sok district, and nearly 3 kg of ice and methamphetamine WY174 tablets were confiscated.
* Second: The case of cracking down on 10 gangsters, MT chickens and BBK gangs for aggravated intentional violence and aggravated intentional damage in Sangkat Boeung Keng Kang 3, Khan Boeung Keng and Sangkat Teuk Thla, Khan Sen Sok, Sangkat Kakap 2, Khan Po Sen Chey, cracked down by the light criminal force and the police force of Boeung Keng Kang district
* Third: Case of unauthorized possession of weapons (recycled knives) arrested 3 gangsters, cracked down by Meanchey district police force
* Fourth: In the case of illegal drug trafficking and intentional violence, aggravated arrest of a suspect and 6 small packages of drug exhibits were suppressed by the Russey Keo district police force.
Currently, the above suspects, the authorities have built a case to be sent to court for legal action.
