Samdech Techo Hun Sen said in an exclusive interview with Mr. Lim Chea Vutha, Director General of Fresh News on the afternoon of June 7, 2024, "It will be a serious mistake and an insult to foreign policy of Cambodia, if Cambodia decides to attend the Ukraine Peace Summit.
The Chairman of the King's Personal Advisory Council, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, added that "Cambodia's non-attendance at the Global Peace Summit is a Cambodian right, and Cambodia should not be barred from participating by China." China does not do this to Cambodia.
"Cambodia's non-participation will also be a big mistake for some political analysts or leaders who always consider China to be a movement to prevent Cambodia from participating. I would like to emphasize that if China wants to do such a thing to Cambodia, China will not be able to prevent Cambodia from participating, "said Samdech Techo Hun Sen, a strong man of Cambodia.
Some Southeast Asian countries have already confirmed their participation: Timor-Leste, the Philippines, Singapore and Thailand. Indonesia, Malaysia, Myanmar, Vietnam, Brunei and Laos have not yet been confirmed.
