(Kampong Cham): Kampong Cham Provincial Election Commission (NEC) held a meeting on the morning of June 7, 2024 for the 5th Senate Election 2024 and the Capital Council, Provincial Council, Municipal Council and District Council Election. The 4th Mandate District Council 2024 at the LBN Hotel in Kampong Cham City, chaired by Kampong Cham Provincial Governor Mr. Un Chanda and Mr. Som Soreida, Member of the National Election Committee.
The provincial governor took the opportunity to express his appreciation to the members of the meeting of local authorities at all levels, political parties, non-governmental organizations and all stakeholders who took care to find the good points encountered in the implementation of work. In the past, it has been discussed vigorously and comprehensively as a key for the next election in Cambodia, we have achieved better results.
Mr. Som Soreida, Member of the National Election Committee, said that the work that the NEC has been doing in the past related to the modernization of the election process, the first of the other modernizations is the preparation of computerized voter lists. In the past, it was difficult for us to update voter registrations manually because we could not know how many registrations there were in our system.
But when we use information technology to compile the voter list, we can know the exact number of voters, we can update and we can legally guarantee a Cambodian citizen has a unique name on the voter list. In addition, the computerized voter list was evaluated for the quality of the complete, accurate and up-to-date list.
