(Ratanakkiri): Pursuant to the high order of the Head of the Royal Government, the Ministry of Interior and the National Police Commissioner, the Ratanakkiri Provincial Police Commissioner has taken care to deploy the intervention force to implement professional measures to patrol and inspect suspicious places throughout Ratanakkiri Province.
In fact, on the morning of June 7, 2024, the light criminal police force in cooperation with the Banlung City Police Force and three high school principals collected children who escaped from school by detaining three female students.
