(Battambang): Ten leaders of the Candlelight Party in Prek Narin commune, Ek Phnom district, Battambang province, have decided to leave their former political party and join the CPP.
Former leaders of the Candlelight Party in Prek Narin commune who left the party include: Mr. Tat Chi, Vice Chairman, Mr. Yoeun Chenda, Member, Mr. Ran Phon, Member, Ms. Cho Chin, Observer, Mr. Bo Vibol, Observer, Mr. Lim Suy Heng, Observer, Mr. Phou Touch, Observer, Mr. Ran Thon, Observer, Ms. Ran Un, Observer and Mr. Chan Oun, Activist.
