(Siem Reap): On the morning of Friday, June 7, 2024, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, HE Samdech Manet, presided over the opening of the ASEAN Ministerial Meeting on Science, Technology and Technology. The 20th innovation organized in the territory of Siem Reap province, the land of famous Khmer temples.
The meeting was attended by Mr. Kao Kim Hourn, Secretary-General of ASEAN, Minister of Science, Technology and Innovation of ASEAN, as well as senior officials of the Royal Government of Cambodia.
The 20th ASEAN Ministerial Meeting on Science, Technology and Innovation was held under the theme "Artificial Intelligence: A Journey to the Future". At the same time, the 85th ASEAN Committee on Science, Technology and Innovation and related meetings were organized.
These meetings will be an important forum for promoting cooperation in the field of science and technology in the region, and as the rotating chair, Cambodia is committed to promoting the enhancement of ASEAN scientific capacity and promoting innovation for sustainable development. .
