The Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) signing ceremony was held on June 6, 2024 under the chairmanship of Mr. Sou Socheat, Royal Government Delegate in charge of the Director General of the Securities Regulator of Cambodia and Honorary Duke Dr. Ly Khun Thai, Chairman of the Board of Directors of Asia Europe University at the Asia Europe University Conference Hall and was attended by about 350 leaders, staff, professors, students and guests.
