Please note that for June 5, 2024, traffic accidents across Cambodia also occurred 4 times, in which 2 people were killed and 4 people were injured (1 person was seriously injured). In five days, there were 39 traffic accidents, resulting in 16 deaths, 63 injuries (37 serious injuries).
Stung Treng Provincial Administration Holds a Meeting to Implement the Order of Samdech Prime Minister to Suppress Gangs
(Stung Treng): The Stung Treng Provincial Administration on the evening of June 05, 2024, held a meeting of the Provincial Unity Command with the Prosecutor of the Provincial Court, the three types of armed forces, the chairmen, the deputy chairmen of the relevant units, the six district inspectors. The 34 police chiefs in order to implement the high order of the Prime Minister Hun Manet to crack down on gangs that cause insecurity everywhere in the local area.
Frequent incidents of gang activity that cause anarchy on public streets, including violence and the use of weapons such as knives, swords, axes, etc., affect public order, social security, especially public safety. .
At the meeting, the Provincial Unity Command pointed out to the three types of armed forces, all police stations must implement regulations to suppress gangsters to ensure security, order and social security.
